        Quote Back in 3–4 Days
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
<section class="section how-it-works">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-label">Simple Process</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">How the Virtual Quote Works</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Start from the comfort of your couch. We only come to you once you're happy with the virtual quote.</p>
    <div class="steps-grid">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">1</div>
        <h3>Fill Out the Form</h3>
        <p>Tell us about your job, your location, and upload a few photos. The more detail, the better your quote.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">2</div>
        <h3>We Review It</h3>
        <p>Our team goes through your submission and prepares a detailed, itemised quote tailored to your specific job.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">3</div>
        <h3>Virtual Quote Sent</h3>
        <p>We get back to you within 3–4 business days with your quote and a call to walk you through everything.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">4</div>
        <h3>Site Visit to Confirm</h3>
        <p>Happy with the quote? We come out to assess the job in person, confirm the final price, and lock in your project start date.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-num">5</div>
        <h3>We Get to Work</h3>
        <p>The project kicks off on the agreed date. We handle everything from here and keep you updated throughout.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FORM SECTION -->
<section class="section form-section" id="quote-form">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="form-wrapper">
      <!-- LEFT: NURTURE -->
      <div class="form-left">
        <div class="section-label">Free &amp; No Obligation</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Ready to Get Started?</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">We've helped hundreds of Melbourne homeowners get the property work they've been putting off. Here's what to expect when you fill out the form.</p>
        <ul class="trust-bullets">
          <li>
            <div class="bullet-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none"><path d="M2 6l3 3 5-5" stroke="#B91C2E" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
            <span><strong>No site visit required.</strong> Just photos and a description. We'll take care of the rest.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="bullet-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none"><path d="M2 6l3 3 5-5" stroke="#B91C2E" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
            <span><strong>Detailed and itemised.</strong> You'll know exactly what you're getting and what it costs.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="bullet-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none"><path d="M2 6l3 3 5-5" stroke="#B91C2E" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
            <span><strong>Back to you within 3–4 business days.</strong> 3–4 days, not weeks — still pretty quick.</span>
          </li>
